Orbita website
==============

This site's design, layout, and component structure are inspired by and adapted
from the animateicons project:

  animateicons — https://github.com/avijit07x/animateicons
  Copyright (c) Avijit Dey
  Licensed under the MIT License.

The original animateicons project is an open-source library of animated icons and
a documentation site built with Next.js, MDX, Tailwind CSS, and framer-motion. We
reused its landing-page and docs layout patterns as a starting point and replaced
all content and icon code with Orbita's own. We gratefully acknowledge the author.

Circuit Board component
-----------------------

components/ui/circuit-board.tsx is vendored from the componentry.dev shadcn
registry (@componentry/circuit-board — https://componentry.dev). The only change
from upstream is repointing the `cn` import to our local util. We use it to draw
the animated architecture illustration and gratefully acknowledge the authors.

